Package: hlx-generator
Version: ${VERSION}
Architecture: ${ARCH}
Maintainer: edonahue <edonahue@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libasound2, libgl1
Recommends: libjack-jackd2-0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Description: HLX Generator — AI Preset Builder & MIDI Soundboard for Line 6 HX Stomp
 A dark-themed desktop application that combines a MIDI soundboard for the
 Line 6 HX Stomp guitar processor with an AI-powered preset builder.
 .
 Features:
  - One-click tone activation via MIDI Program Change / Bank Select
  - Snapshot, tuner, tap tempo, looper, and expression pedal control
  - AI tone generation via Anthropic Claude, OpenAI GPT, or Google Gemini
  - Preset catalog and export to .hlx format
